    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "PROPERTY PARTNERS O'BRIEN SWAINE have the pleasure of offering this spacious two bed ground floor apartment which has been repainted throughout and now comes to market offering two double bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a large light filled living area.\r\n\r\nThis bright and spacious apartment has recently been vacated by the most recent tenant and therefore is unaffected by current rent caps making this a clever investment or an excellent purchase for a first time buyer.\r\nNicely positioned in this popular development surrounded by landscape gardens and benefiting from secure gated access and underground parking.\r\n\r\nThis property is also a short distance from excellent public transport links including the 13, 68, 69 bus routes and the Luas Red Line (Red Cow Stop).  The N7 & M50 motorways are also very easily accessed, as is the Liffey Valley Shopping Centre and the Square Shopping Centre both only a short drive away.  Clondalkin village is serviced with excellent facilities including local GP services, medical centre's, sports and recreational clubs and many shopping outlets.  There are also highly regarded primary and secondary schools including Colaiste Chilliain, Scoil Naomh Áine & Moyle Park College.  Bordering Clondalkin to the west you will find the picturesque Corkagh Park which is one of Dublin’s largest parks covering over 290 acres where local residents enjoy many amenities such as  a large playground area , fishing lakes, pet farm, a dog park, cycling, running and a host of other sporting facilities.\r\nAccommodation includes: Entrance hall, livingroom, kitchen, 2 bedrooms, ensuite and bathroom"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SPECIAL FEATURES\r\n\tDouble glazed windows\r\n\tElectric storage heating\r\n\tEnsuite and main bathroom\r\n\tExtends to approximately 67 Sq metres\r\n\tBER: C2\r\n\tUnderground parking\r\n\tGated secure development\r\n\tBuilt in wardrobes\r\n\tBuilt c:2004\r\n\tBright and spacious living accommodation\r\n\tSuperb location within walking distance of Clondalkin Village and all its amenities"
      },
      {
